{"t":"ULTA","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"Ulta Beauty, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Specialty Retail","employees":21382,"hq":"Bolingbrook, IL, United States","website":"https://www.ulta.com","summary_en":"Ulta Beauty, Inc. operates as a specialty beauty retailer in the United States, Mexico, and Kuwait. The company offers branded and private label beauty products, including cosmetics, fragrance, haircare, skincare, bath and body products, professional hair products, and salon styling tools through its Ulta Beauty stores, shop-in-shops, Ulta.com website, and its mobile applications. It also provides wellness products. The company was formerly known as ULTA Salon, Cosmetics & Fragrance, Inc. and changed its name to Ulta Beauty, Inc. in January 2017. Ulta Beauty, Inc. was incorporated in 1990 and is based in Bolingbrook, Illinois.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Ulta Beauty, Inc.는 미국, 멕시코, 쿠웨이트에서 전문 뷰티 소매업체로 운영되고 있습니다. 회사는 Ulta Beauty 매장, 숍인숍, Ulta.com 웹사이트 및 모바일 애플리케이션을 통해 화장품, 향수, 헤어케어, 스킨케어, 목욕 및 바디 제품, 전문 헤어 제품, 미용실 스타일링 도구를 포함한 브랜드 및 개인 상표 미용 제품을 제공합니다. 웰니스 제품도 제공한다. 이 회사는 이전에 ULTA Salon, Cosmetics & Fragrance, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2017년 1월에 Ulta Beauty, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Ulta Beauty, Inc.는 1990년에 설립되었으며 일리노이주 볼링브룩에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":652.08,"mcap":27881293824.0,"pe":23.76385,"fpe":20.30625,"peg":2.0892,"ps":2.1520789,"pb":10.557948,"ev_ebitda":15.763,"div":0.0,"beta":0.838,"hi52":714.97,"lo52":443.6},"fin":{"rev":12955516928.0,"rev_g":0.089,"eps_g":0.133,"gross":0.43097,"op":0.1246,"net":0.0934,"roe":0.46117002,"fcf":914087360.0,"cash":213451008.0,"debt":2524030976.0,"de":95.472,"eps":27.44,"feps":32.11228},"own":{"short":0.0477,"inst":1.0291101,"insider":0.0025099998},"analyst":{"n":25,"mean":642.12,"median":645.0,"high":731.0,"low":500.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.82143,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":15,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":15,"hold":8,"sell":0,"